# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data — raw data is immutable and re-downloadable; never commit it (3 GB).
#
# Provenance IS committed: manifests and sidecars are the reproducibility
# record (Context.md §33), and they are what makes a result checkable without
# the bytes it came from.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/**
!data/**/
!data/**/.gitkeep
!data/**/*.manifest.json
!data/raw/_manifest.jsonl
!data/processed/*.provenance.json

# Processed tables are derived and regenerable, EXCEPT the deliverables
# Context.md §36, §37 and §21 name explicitly as outputs. At a few MB each
# this costs little, and it lets a reader check each report's numbers
# without a 3 GB download.
!data/processed/parkinsons_targets.parquet
!data/processed/disease_target_features.parquet
!data/processed/labels.parquet
!data/processed/app_scores.parquet
# Browsable evidence detail (Context.md §21) — presentation artifacts built by
# scripts/build_evidence_detail.py from raw Reactome/GTEx/STRING, which are NOT
# in the container image. Tracked for the same reason app_scores.parquet is: a
# clean checkout must be able to build a working image.
!data/processed/target_pathways.parquet
!data/processed/target_tissue_expression.parquet
!data/processed/target_interactions.parquet

# Models (artifacts, not source) EXCEPT the Milestone 2 deliverable
# (Context.md §37) and the Milestone 3 held-out fold models (Context.md §21,
# milestone3_plan.md §2.1) — persisted so the app's XGBoost score matches
# what baseline_metrics.json's leave-one-disease-out numbers actually
# measured, rather than the in-sample all-disease refit.
models/trained/**
!models/trained/.gitkeep
!models/trained/xgboost_baseline.json
!models/trained/folds/
!models/trained/folds/*.json
models/metadata/**
!models/metadata/.gitkeep

# Report figures are committed: reports/*.md embeds them, and an ignored image
# renders as a broken link on GitHub. Regenerate with scripts/run_milestone1.py.
reports/figures/**
!reports/figures/.gitkeep
!reports/figures/*.png

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.eggs/

# Environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
.python-version

# Tooling caches
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
coverage.xml

# Notebooks
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Experiment tracking
mlruns/
wandb/
.optuna/

# Secrets & local config
.env
.env.local
*.local.yaml

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.swp
